  "title": "Rogers Communications Declares 50 Cents per Share Quarterly Dividend",
  "summary": "October 2, 2026 payment date following September 8, 2026 record date TORONTO, July 22, 2026 — Rogers Communications Inc. (TSX: RCI.A and RCI.B) (NYSE: RCI) (“Rogers”) announced that a quarterly dividend totaling 50 cents per share (the “Quarterly Dividend”) has been declared on each of its outstanding Class B Non-Voting […]",
